<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23420" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δᾰν-είζω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-είσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					35.52
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδάνεισα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					3.1.34
				</span></i>
			, etc.: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεδάνεικα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					35.52
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, ibid.: fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δανείσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					32.15
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδανεισάμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					12.59
				</span></i>
			, etc.: pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεδάνεισμαι</span> in med. sense, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				6.5.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				37.53
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδανείσθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					2.4.28
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				33.12
			</span></i>: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεδάνεισμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					36.5
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				49.53
			</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάνος</span>):—<i>put out
				money at usury, lend,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12.302.56
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				842
			</span></i>, al.; more fully, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἐπὶ τόκῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					742c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ ὀκτὼ ὀβολοῖς τὴν μνᾶν δ. τοῦ
					μηνὸς ἑκάστου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					53.13
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.107
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἐπὶ τούτοις τοῖς
			ἀνδραπόδοις</span> on the security of . ., <i><span class="en">
				D.
				27.27
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τοῖς σώμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ath.</u>
					9.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὰ ἡμέτερα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					27.28
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δανεῖσαι χρήματα εἰς τὸν Πόντον καὶ
					πάλιν Ἀθήναζε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					35.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>have lent to one, borrow,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				1306
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					17.2
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τοῖς μεγάλοις
			[τόκοις</span>] <i><span class="en">
				D.
				1.15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἐγγείων τόκων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					34.23
				</span></i>
			:—
				Act.
			 and 
				Med.
			 opposed, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδώσουσι οἱ
				δανεισάμενοι τοῖς δανείσασι τὸ γιγνόμενον
			ἀργύριον</span> ap.<i><span class="en">
				D.
				35.11
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, of the money, <i>to be lent out,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				756
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.4.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				33.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph. in 
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόρια ἀπὸ τοῦ κόσμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					42e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδώσετέ μοι ἃ ἐδανείσασθε ἐν τῷ
					λόγῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					612c
				</span></i>
			.</div>
